# 393. App Configuration API

Saat Splash Screen

```
GET

/app/config
```

Response

```json
{
  "maintenance":false,
  "forceUpdate":false,
  "minimumVersion":"1.0.0",
  "latestVersion":"1.1.0",
  "theme":"default",
  "language":"id",
  "featureVersion":"20260726"
}
```

